{"id":"n54761-1-8","stage":5,"title":"몸집 · 个头","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n54761-1-8-1","ko":"쟤는 왜 저렇게 뚱뚱할까?","zh":"他为什么那么胖啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"쟤는","meaning":"“저 아이(那个孩子)”的缩略语。","explanation":"쟤：“저 아이(那个孩子)”的缩略语；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"쟤","audio":"/audio/07345a466b2427d03046.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71213","senseId":"1","lemma":"쟤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쟤는","audio":"/audio/75fff6510e5032dd7e75.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"저렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"저렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"저렇다","audio":"/audio/07e99c1628a5077b51a7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71226","senseId":"1","lemma":"저렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저렇게","audio":"/audio/3e51b4147d3689f85089.mp3"}},{"text":"뚱뚱할까?","meaning":"胖乎乎","explanation":"뚱뚱하다：胖乎乎；ㄹ까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"뚱뚱하다","audio":"/audio/4a1e91e508bf1cde3fa1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15191","senseId":"1","lemma":"뚱뚱하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뚱뚱할까","audio":"/audio/1f679a07134da8168412.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"07345a466b2427d0","term":"쟤","zh":"“저 아이(那个孩子)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/07345a466b2427d03046.mp3","entryId":"71213","definition":"“저 아이(那个孩子)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"07e99c1628a5077b","term":"저렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/07e99c1628a5077b51a7.mp3","entryId":"71226","definition":"性质、模样、状态等与那个一样。","pronunciation":["저러